# Step 003 — ADD_CONTRACT STORE_XDUO_0001 MaterialProxy

```step
anchor: ADD_CONTRACT
id: STORE_XDUO_0001
name: MaterialProxy
kind: proxy
language: fsharp
declaring_project: OpticalConstructor.Domain
touches: [OpticalConstructor.Domain, OpticalConstructor.Tests]
